      <p>V8-compatible batch-processing scripts for PixInsight 1.9.4 and later.</p>
      <p>Repository: https://github.com/Fluorine7/Fluorine7-PixInsight-Scripts</p>
   </description>
   <platform os="all" arch="noarch" version="1.9.4:2.0.0">
      <package fileName="Fluorine7BatchScripts-1.0.3.zip" sha1="e02c7dd9ef591f1bb9349f1c531a0f0091581fe3" type="script" releaseDate="20260916091344">
         <title>Fluorine7 PixInsight Batch Scripts 1.0.3</title>
         <remove>src/scripts/rename_xisf_fits.js,src/scripts/Fluorine7/ExpandIntegration-Comet-GUI-V8.js,src/scripts/Fluorine7/ExpandIntegration-Comet-GUI-V8.xsgn,src/scripts/Fluorine7/rename_xisf_fits_v1.2_V8.js,src/scripts/Fluorine7/rename_xisf_fits_v1.2_V8.xsgn</remove>
         <description>
            <p>Fixes removal of obsolete script filenames and signatures to prevent duplicate menu entries after upgrading. All four scripts are unchanged from 1.0.2.</p>
            <ul>
               <li>Rename By FITS Header 1.3</li>
               <li>Expand Integration 1.3</li>
               <li>Batch Image Keyword Editor 4.0</li>
               <li>Batch XISF Cleaner 1.0</li>
            </ul>
            <p>All scripts are installed under Script &gt; Batch Processing.</p>
         </description>
